  "identifier": "ntriples",
  "description": "Provides lightweight, dependency-minimal tools for serializing RDF N-Triples in R. Supports IRI validation, typed RDF literals, date-time serialization, and provenance statements for `utils::person` objects using PROV-O or FOAF. Designed for reuse by packages implementing higher-level RDF data models and provenance workflows.",
